WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:08.042 --> 00:00:08.675
&gt;&gt; Sean: BREAKING NEWS TODAY

00:00:08.709 --> 00:00:09.574
&gt;&gt; Sean: BREAKING NEWS TODAY

00:00:09.608 --> 00:00:10.955
THE CHINESE GOVERNMENT

00:00:10.956 --> 00:00:12.838
THREATENING TO READ RETALIATE

00:00:12.840 --> 00:00:14.883
WEDNESDAY AFTER THE CHINESE

00:00:14.918 --> 00:00:16.368
CLOSED A CONSULATE IN HOUSTON,

00:00:16.402 --> 00:00:16.997
TEXAS.

00:00:17.031 --> 00:00:19.356
CONCERNS IT WAS BEING USED FOR

00:00:19.390 --> 00:00:19.989
ESPIONAGE.

00:00:20.024 --> 00:00:22.319
THIS AFTER THE DOJ ANNOUNCED IT

00:00:22.320 --> 00:00:24.389
HAS CHARGED TO CODE CHINESE

00:00:24.424 --> 00:00:26.259
HACKERS WITH TRYING TO STEAL

00:00:26.260 --> 00:00:27.738
UNITED STATES CORONAVIRUS RESEAR

00:00:27.773 --> 00:00:29.211
HERE WITH REACTION LOUISIANA

00:00:29.245 --> 00:00:30.721
SENATOR JOHN KENNEDY.

00:00:30.723 --> 00:00:33.378
YOU HAVE BEEN VERY OUTSPOKEN ON

00:00:33.380 --> 00:00:33.869
THIS.

00:00:33.903 --> 00:00:37.605
LOOK, THE FACT THAT AFTER ALL OF

00:00:37.606 --> 00:00:40.091
THESE YEARS THAT WE HAD PEOPLE

00:00:40.125 --> 00:00:42.470
30 AND 40 YEARS AGO HACKING INTO

00:00:42.504 --> 00:00:43.459
GOVERNMENT AGENCIES.

00:00:43.494 --> 00:00:45.474
WE DON’T FIX THIS ANNOYS THE

00:00:45.508 --> 00:00:47.583
LIVING DAYLIGHTS OUT OF ME.

00:00:47.618 --> 00:00:49.450
WHAT POINT IS THAT OUR PROBLEM

00:00:49.484 --> 00:00:51.561
AND OUR FAULT?

00:00:51.562 --> 00:00:54.871
SPEAK WITH THE COMMUNIST PARTY

00:00:54.905 --> 00:00:57.413
IN CHINA HAS BECOME A WORLD

00:00:57.446 --> 00:00:58.684
COMORBIDITY.

00:00:58.685 --> 00:01:01.173
AN AMERICA ALLOWED IT.

00:01:01.175 --> 00:01:03.757
FOR WELL OVER 20 YEARS.

00:01:03.792 --> 00:01:07.322
TOO MANY OF OUR LEADERS GOT UP

00:01:07.323 --> 00:01:10.789
EVERY DAY AND JUST TOOK THE

00:01:10.823 --> 00:01:13.103
BULLET TRYING TO -- WE DIDN’T

00:01:13.137 --> 00:01:14.789
STAND UP TO CHINA.

00:01:14.790 --> 00:01:16.200
NOW, WE ARE.

00:01:16.201 --> 00:01:18.477
AND WE ASKED OTHER COUNTRIES TO

00:01:18.478 --> 00:01:20.125
JOIN WITH US.

00:01:20.126 --> 00:01:22.797
I DON’T WANT A WAR WITH CHINA.

00:01:22.798 --> 00:01:25.113
CHINA SAYS THE COMMUNIST PARTY,

00:01:25.148 --> 00:01:27.355
SAYS IT WANTS RESPECT.

00:01:27.356 --> 00:01:30.135
YOU HAVE TO EARN RESPECT.

00:01:30.169 --> 00:01:31.766
RESPECT IS NOT A PARTICIPATION

00:01:31.767 --> 00:01:32.580
TROPHY.

00:01:32.581 --> 00:01:35.593
THEY HAVE TO SHOW THAT THEY ARE

00:01:35.628 --> 00:01:36.853
WILLING TO BE POSTED

00:01:36.887 --> 00:01:39.730
STAKEHOLDERS IN A STABLE LAW AND

00:01:39.731 --> 00:01:40.260
ORDER.

00:01:40.295 --> 00:01:43.483
AND VERNACULAR THAT MEANS THEY

00:01:43.484 --> 00:01:44.872
HAVE TO STOP CHEATING.

00:01:44.906 --> 00:01:48.012
&gt;&gt; Sean: INNOCENT PEOPLE DIED

00:01:48.014 --> 00:01:50.635
BECAUSE OF ALL OF THEIR LIVES.

00:01:50.636 --> 00:01:53.446
THEY NOW WANT TO STEAL OUR

00:01:53.448 --> 00:01:53.981
INFORMATION.

00:01:53.982 --> 00:01:56.001
THE INTELLECTUAL PROPERTY THEFT

00:01:56.035 --> 00:01:58.236
HAS BEEN A HUGE PROBLEM.

00:01:58.270 --> 00:02:00.732
TRADE IMBALANCE A HUGE PROBLEM.

00:02:00.733 --> 00:02:04.817
WE MUST NOW REMOVE ALL OF THE

00:02:04.851 --> 00:02:06.109
MANUFACTURING FOR VITAL ITEMS

00:02:06.111 --> 00:02:07.640
LIKE PHARMACEUTICALS AND

00:02:07.641 --> 00:02:08.046
MEDICINES.

00:02:08.080 --> 00:02:10.534
WHAT DO YOU PROPOSE WE DO?

00:02:10.535 --> 00:02:14.314
&gt;&gt; THE FIRST THING THAT I WOULD

00:02:14.315 --> 00:02:17.739
DO IS ASK OTHER MEMBERS OF THE

00:02:17.740 --> 00:02:20.329
WESTERN WORLD TO JOIN WITH US.

00:02:20.330 --> 00:02:22.106
AUSTRALIA IS ALREADY THEY ARE.

00:02:22.140 --> 00:02:23.929
THE UNITED KINGDOM IS ALREADY

00:02:23.930 --> 00:02:24.429
THERE.

00:02:24.464 --> 00:02:26.850
BUT I’M THINKING SPECIFICALLY OF

00:02:26.851 --> 00:02:30.094
OUR FRIENDS IN EUROPE, THE E.U.

00:02:30.095 --> 00:02:32.693
IT IS TIME THAT THE E.U. GREW

00:02:32.728 --> 00:02:35.041
SOME ORANGES AND SAID, YOU KNOW,

00:02:35.042 --> 00:02:36.594
WE STAND FOR SOMETHING.

00:02:36.628 --> 00:02:38.276
IT’S BEEN WHEN THEY ARE WEAK.

00:02:38.278 --> 00:02:39.949
&gt;&gt; THEY ARE WEAK.

00:02:39.984 --> 00:02:41.561
&gt;&gt; AND THEY COULD BE MUCH

00:02:41.596 --> 00:02:42.246
STRONGER.

00:02:42.247 --> 00:02:45.122
BUT THEY ARE SO WORRIED ABOUT

00:02:45.156 --> 00:02:47.548
MAKING MONEY FROM AND WITH

00:02:47.582 --> 00:02:49.226
CHINA, THAT IN MY JUDGMENT, THEY

00:02:49.227 --> 00:02:50.583
SACRIFICED THEIR VALUES.

00:02:50.584 --> 00:02:52.544
I DON’T MEAN TO OVERSTATE IT.

00:02:52.578 --> 00:02:53.810
THERE HAVE BEEN A FEW COUNTRIES

00:02:53.844 --> 00:02:57.552
THAT HAVE PUSHED BACK, BUT THEY

00:02:57.587 --> 00:03:01.338
NEED TO PUSH BACK AS A GROUP, AS

00:03:01.371 --> 00:03:02.923
AN ORGANIZATION, PARTICULARLY IN

00:03:02.925 --> 00:03:03.381
GERMANY.

00:03:03.415 --> 00:03:05.602
&gt;&gt; Sean: WELL, I AGREE WITH

00:03:05.636 --> 00:03:05.965
EVERYTHING.

00:03:06.000 --> 00:03:08.265
PEOPLE IN YOUR STATE IN EVERY

00:03:08.300 --> 00:03:09.916
STATE IN THIS COUNTRY DIED

00:03:09.917 --> 00:03:11.138
BECAUSE OF WHAT THEY DID.

00:03:11.139 --> 00:03:12.568
AND AROUND THE WORLD.

00:03:12.569 --> 00:03:14.108
WHY WOULDN’T PEOPLE UNITE ON

00:03:14.109 --> 00:03:14.615
THAT?

00:03:14.649 --> 00:03:16.508
WE HAVE ABOUT 20 SECONDS.

00:03:16.542 --> 00:03:18.934
&gt;&gt; IT IS NOT JUST A CORONAVIRUS.

